WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.930
"You play the guitar so well, Fiona," Carabas said.

2
00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:14.997
"You're an amazing musician."

3
00:00:14.998 --> 00:00:21.996
Fiona laughed. "I practice a lot."

4
00:00:21.997 --> 00:00:25.051
She handed Carabas the guitar.

5
00:00:25.052 --> 00:00:28.301
"Let me hear you play."

6
00:00:28.302 --> 00:00:35.149
Carabas strummed the guitar.

7
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:38.443
The king whispered in Fiona's ear.

8
00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:41.938
"Carabas would make a great husband.

9
00:00:41.939 --> 00:00:45.636
He's rich and owns lots of land."

10
00:00:45.637 --> 00:00:58.353
Fiona shrugged. "I want a husband who is kind."

11
00:00:58.354 --> 00:01:05.904
Puss walked up the hill.

12
00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:10.139
He knocked on the castle's door.

13
00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.157
A young man opened it. "Yes?"

14
00:01:14.158 --> 00:01:18.315
"I'd like to speak with the ogre," Puss said.

15
00:01:18.316 --> 00:01:22.013
"The ogre is out," the man said.

16
00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:31.135
"You may come in and wait for him."

17
00:01:31.136 --> 00:01:34.391
The man led Puss into a room.

18
00:01:34.392 --> 00:01:44.583
"Sit," he said. "Make yourself comfortable."

19
00:01:44.584 --> 00:01:49.157
The man called to a servant. "Bring us tea!"

20
00:01:49.158 --> 00:01:53.845
"Y-yes, sir!" The servant hurried away.

21
00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:59.982
He soon came back.

22
00:01:59.983 --> 00:02:03.748
His hand shook as he poured the tea.

23
00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:08.008
"Why is the servant so nervous?" Puss thought.

24
00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:10.855
He looked around.

25
00:02:10.856 --> 00:02:14.380
Other servants stood nearby.

26
00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:18.143
They all looked nervous too.

27
00:02:18.144 --> 00:02:20.742
"Hmm," Puss thought.

28
00:02:20.743 --> 00:02:24.796
"Now I'm beginning to get nervous."

29
00:02:24.797 --> 00:02:27.337
He stood up.

30
00:02:27.338 --> 00:02:30.420
"Thank you," Puss said to the man.

31
00:02:30.421 --> 00:02:32.490
"But I need to go now.

32
00:02:32.491 --> 00:02:38.547
I must—"

33
00:02:38.548 --> 00:02:42.550
The man suddenly grew big and green.

34
00:02:42.551 --> 00:02:45.551
His face became ugly.

35
00:02:45.552 --> 00:02:53.500
Puss gasped. "You're the ogre!"

